; refuse AX3006
; An effect operation and a top-level `fn` of one spelling. The
; operation is declared first, so the `fn` is the duplicate and the
; span points at it.
;
; THIS FILE REPLACES `020-trait-duplicate`, which asked the same
; question of a trait method. What is being pinned is that a global
; value-namespace occupant COLLIDES rather than being quietly won by
; whichever declaration the pass order reached last.
(effect Sz (
  sz :: (-> Int Int)
))

(fn (sz n) 7)

(:: main Int)

(fn (main) 0)
